<title>DUBAI: Dubai silver re-exports to India fall in October.</title>
<headline>Dubai silver re-exports to India fall in October.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Re-exports of silver from the Gulf Arab emirate of Dubai to India fell to 45.402 tonnes in October from 59.691 tonnes the previous month, figures compiled by Dubai customs showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Re-exports in October 1995 were 48.558 tonnes.</p>
<p>Silver flows to Saudi Arabia edged back to 1.435 tonnes in October from 1.715 tonnes in September, customs figures showed.</p>
<p>-- Steven Swindells, Dubai Newsroom, +971 4 6071255.</p>
</text>
